{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"sglang-mem-fraction-static-tuning","content_sha256":"sha256:ec025ac833a0b9a0f8b7e256b9ee030a925931009cf6ea09fd1526bde3b7dc4b","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789959334.330818,"domain":"llm-inference","explanation":"mem_fraction_static 决定预留给静态部分(权重与 KV 池)的显存比例。调大→KV 池更大→更高并发与前缀缓存,但激活/图捕获余量变小易 OOM;OOM 时通常适度下调,KV 太小影响吞吐时适度上调。","id":"q-infer-mag6-sglang-mem-fraction-static-tuning-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"它是留给模型权重+KV cache 的静态显存占比;调大可分更多显存给 KV(提升并发/前缀缓存命中),但留给运行时激活/CUDA graph 的余量变小,过大反而 OOM,需与实际显存折中"},{"id":"b","text":"它控制采样温度"},{"id":"c","text":"它只影响日志级别"},{"id":"d","text":"它等于 tensor parallel size"}],"prompt":"SGLang 启动报 KV cache 太小/容易 OOM,--mem-fraction-static 这个参数控制什么、该如何调？","review_state":null,"rubric":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"diagnosis","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"SGLang server arguments","url":"https://docs.sglang.ai/backend/server_arguments.html"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"engine","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
